    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Nightmare Owl,&quot; step into the haunting first-person horror world of Chrissy, who is trapped in a nightmare she cannot escape. After discovering a satanic book on her family\u2019s old farm, she becomes ensnared in a terrifying dreamscape where demons relentlessly hunt her. The only hope for survival lies in finding the elusive owl, a mysterious guide that holds the key to escaping this dark and twisted realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the eerie remnants of the farm, you must outwit and outrun the demonic forces that lurk in the shadows. With nothing but a flashlight to light your way, you\u2019ll uncover riddles, search for hidden clues, and use whatever means necessary to survive the night. But beware\u2014each step brings you closer to danger, and only the owl can show you the path to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have the courage to face your fears and break the nightmare\u2019s grip, or will you be trapped in the darkness forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND MELEE WEAPONS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons to break objects or defend yourself from demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, the demons attack very fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/ceccd800874025142bbcfd68611f49b0.poster.avif?t=1744186495\" width=646 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/ceccd800874025142bbcfd68611f49b0.webm?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/ceccd800874025142bbcfd68611f49b0.mp4?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GET TO THE FLASHLIGHT FAST!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in the dark most of the time so the flashlight is needed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Flashlight is usually close to you when you enter the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/eb1fb9fd43c7343e24db7eace0e0e63c.poster.avif?t=1744186495\" width=646 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/eb1fb9fd43c7343e24db7eace0e0e63c.webm?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/eb1fb9fd43c7343e24db7eace0e0e63c.mp4?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND THE OWL </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the owl with the flashlight to be directed through</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/f0df1e133f6328163196cbfaab16ccc1.poster.avif?t=1744186495\" width=646 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/f0df1e133f6328163196cbfaab16ccc1.webm?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/f0df1e133f6328163196cbfaab16ccc1.mp4?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE THE FLASHLIGHT UV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The flashlight has UV abilities which kill demons within</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > the nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/002ba7ee98d0e92dda3e2a9a24098285.poster.avif?t=1744186495\" width=646 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/002ba7ee98d0e92dda3e2a9a24098285.webm?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/002ba7ee98d0e92dda3e2a9a24098285.mp4?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND HIDING PLACES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find places to hide if you are cornered by demons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/b25cfcc59055e2f808e0d874dbcf9856.poster.avif?t=1744186495\" width=646 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/b25cfcc59055e2f808e0d874dbcf9856.webm?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3373680/extras/b25cfcc59055e2f808e0d874dbcf9856.mp4?t=1744186495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
